## 🔗 Booking Links
- Setter Booking Link: Calendly being built — link drops here + pinned in Slack 1-general the day it's live
- Closer Calendars: added as closers are onboarded — one line per closer, kept current by Daniel
Until links are live, no self-serve bookings happen — every call is booked live on the phone per the Sales Process page.
---
## 📋 Booking Rules
- Only book qualified leads — see Fundamental Checklist before booking anyone
- Book on the closest available time slot — urgency matters. Don't push them to next week if today is available.
- Always confirm time zone with prospect before booking — do not assume
- Send a calendar confirmation immediately after booking
- Notify the closer via Slack within 5 minutes of every booking
- Update lead status in Close CRM to "Booked" immediately after
---
<callout icon="⚡" color="yellow_bg">
	Every booking must be followed by a Slack message to the closer AND a CRM status update within 5 minutes. No exceptions.
</callout>
